{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":1294368,"username":"mdi47","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/mdi47/{size}/305011_2.png","created_at":"2024-12-18T10:30:45.000Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi all,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m trying to import products that contain variant metafields, but I’m running into some issues. Here’s what I’ve done so far:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI set up variant metafields on one of my products directly in the admin.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTo understand the correct format, I exported that same product to a CSV file, hoping to see the metafield columns and values.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUnfortunately, when I opened the CSV, there were no metafield columns or values for the variants included.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m a bit stuck. I was expecting to see something in the CSV that I could replicate for my bulk import. Is there a recommended workflow to get variant metafields included in the CSV export/import process?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestions:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHas anyone successfully imported variant metafields via CSV, and if so, how did you format your file?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAre variant metafields just not supported in the standard Shopify CSV import/export process, or am I missing something?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIs there a third-party app that can handle variant metafields import/export more seamlessly?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m open to suggestions or any best practices you’ve found. Ideally, I’d like to manage variant metafields in bulk without manually editing each product in the admin after import.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks in advance for any guidance or recommendations!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":8,"updated_at":"2024-12-18T10:30:45.000Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1790,"reads":0,"readers_count":0,"score":8965.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":381686,"topic_slug":"import-products-with-variant-metafields-via-csv","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":988960,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/import-products-with-variant-metafields-via-csv/381686/1","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"calendar_details":[],"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":1294369,"username":"DaisyVo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/daisyvo/{size}/109567_2.png","created_at":"2024-12-18T16:36:05.000Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi, Mdi47\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo Answer Your Questions:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHas anyone successfully imported variant metafields via CSV?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot directly via Shopify’s native CSV, but using apps like Matrixify or APIs, you can achieve this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAre variant metafields supported in the standard Shopify CSV?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo, the standard Shopify CSV does not support metafields.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso you can try:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse Shopify Admin’s Bulk Editor\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile not ideal for large-scale changes, the Shopify Admin bulk editor can manage metafields.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGo to \u003cstrong\u003eProducts \u0026gt; All Products\u003c/strong\u003e in the Shopify Admin.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUse the checkboxes to select the products you want to edit.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick \u003cstrong\u003eEdit products\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd variant metafield columns to the bulk editor for manual updates.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI hope this helps\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBest,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDaisy\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":8,"updated_at":"2024-12-18T16:36:05.000Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":110,"reads":0,"readers_count":0,"score":550.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":381686,"topic_slug":"import-products-with-variant-metafields-via-csv","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1421958,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/import-products-with-variant-metafields-via-csv/381686/2","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1294370,"username":"Ieva","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/ieva/{size}/321322_2.png","created_at":"2024-12-18T16:45:12.000Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mdi47\"\u003e@mdi47\u003c/a\u003e !\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/daisyvo\"\u003e@DaisyVo\u003c/a\u003e for the mention!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMatrixify sure is able to update Variant Metafield in bulk and we also \u003ca href=\"https://matrixify.app/tutorials/how-to-manage-shopify-metafields/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eoffer a great tutorial\u003c/a\u003e on how that can be done. The tutorial should be able to do a good job at guiding you through the process, however, please do not hesitate to \u003ca href=\"https://matrixify.app/contact-us/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ereach out to our support\u003c/a\u003e if you have any questions at all, we would be happy to help in any way we can!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":8,"updated_at":"2024-12-18T16:45:12.000Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":59,"reads":0,"readers_count":0,"score":295.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":381686,"topic_slug":"import-products-with-variant-metafields-via-csv","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://matrixify.app/tutorials/how-to-manage-shopify-metafields/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"How to manage Shopify Metafields? - Matrixify App","clicks":60},{"url":"https://matrixify.app/contact-us/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Contact Us - Matrixify App","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":469144,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/import-products-with-variant-metafields-via-csv/381686/3","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1294371,"username":"MMP58","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/mmp58/{size}/335691_2.png","created_at":"2025-01-11T19:03:41.000Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eWhen in the bulk edit in your products list, you can add and remove columns to be seen when “bulking”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eif you pay attention, the URL in your browser will change accordingly with the columns shown (namespace and key will be there).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ein my CSV i added an extra column and named it “metafield title (product.metafields.namespace.key)”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMy actual column was “\u003cstrong\u003eYMM (product.metafields.custom.ymm)\u003c/strong\u003e” - This is working on product level, and i am able to upload metafield data from the CSV with this additional column.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ehowever, i am trying to follow same procedure at variant level, but i am not getting my values “set” despite import being successful.\u003cbr\u003e\nCSV column: “\u003cstrong\u003eVariant-YMM (variant.metafields.custom.variant_ymm)\u003c/strong\u003e”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnyone know what should do the trick??\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":8,"updated_at":"2025-01-11T19:03:41.000Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_cou