ds (material, care instructions, etc.) across my catalog and I’ve hit a wall. \nThe native bulk editor doesn’t seem to give me access to variant-level metafields, so I’m editing them one by \u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"visibility_reason_id":5,"tags":[{"id":5078,"name":"product-page","slug":"product-page"},{"id":3645,"name":"metafields","slug":"metafields"},{"id":305,"name":"editions","slug":"editions"},{"id":1118,"name":"metacampos","slug":"metacampos"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":3,"views":520,"category_id":211,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":2,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"Original Poster","user":{"id":1632120,"username":"Tecno_Vamos","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/c37758/{size}.png","trust_level":0}},{"extras":null,"description":"Frequent Poster","user":{"id":1641360,"username":"Jack_BuildsShopify","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/j/8e8cbc/{size}.png","trust_level":1}},{"extras":null,"description":"Frequent Poster","user":{"id":1639786,"username":"Dhruvi_Maheshwari","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/a587f6/{size}.png","trust_level":1}},{"extras":null,"description":"Recent Poster","user":{"id":3,"username":"jasonh","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/jasonh/{size}/12_2.png","flair_name":"staff","flair_url":"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/1X/881deaa112f3332cf57804cf22cdffe1f01d8372.svg","flair_group_id":3,"primary_group_name":"LF_cohort_pilot","admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":4}},{"extras":"latest","description":"Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":1642601,"username":"askomni","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/f17d59/{size}.png","trust_level":0}}]},{"fancy_title":"Is the value of variant metafields retained after a product CSV import?","id":105345,"title":"Is the value of variant metafields retained after a product CSV import?","slug":"is-the-value-of-variant-metafields-retained-after-a-product-csv-import","posts_count":2,"reply_count":0,"highest_post_number":0,"image_url":null,"created_at":"2022-03-09T19:11:33.000Z","last_posted_at":"2022-03-10T04:41:50.000Z","bumped":true,"bumped_at":"2022-03-10T04:41:50.000Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"I’m looking at replacing an internal product tag used for inventory control with a variant-level true/false metafield. Am I correct that it seems like there’s no way to add the metafield value in bulk and it must be done\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"tags":[],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":0,"views":116,"category_id":211,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":0,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"Original Poster","user":{"id":85447,"username":"amanda-91","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/amanda-91/{size}/224517_2.png","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","trust_level":2}},{"extras":"latest","description":"Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":137018,"username":"LitExtension","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/litextension/{size}/112399_2.png","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","trust_level":2}}]}],"summarizable":true,"has_cached_summary":true,"ai_summary":{"id":144576,"summarized_text":"A user is attempting to bulk import products with variant metafields via CSV but discovered that Shopify's native CSV export doesn't include metafield columns or values. The standard Shopify CSV import/export process does not support metafields at either product or variant level.\n\n**Suggested Solutions:**\n- Use third-party apps like Matrixify, which can handle variant metafield imports and provides tutorials for the process\n- Utilize Shopify Admin's Bulk Editor for smaller-scale metafield updates by adding metafield columns manually\n- For product-level metafields: Add custom columns using the format \"metafield title (product.metafields.namespace.key)\" based on the URL parameters visible in the bulk editor\n\n**Ongoing Issues:**\n- One user successfully imported product-level metafields using the custom column method but reports the same approach isn't working for variant-level metafields\n- Rich Text metafields may not import correctly using this method; converting content to HTML before upload is suggested as a potential workaround\n\nThe discussion remains open with users testing various approaches for both variant metafields and Rich Text field types.","algorithm":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","outdated":false,"created_at":"2025-11-02T11:25:56.031Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T11:25:56.031Z"},"is_category_expert_question":null,"has_livestream":null,"livestream_chat_active":false,"valid_reactions":["heart","+1","laughing","open_mouth","clap","confetti_ball","hugs"],"has_accepted_answer":false,"shared_issue_count":0,"can_create_shared_issue":false,"shared_issue_visible":true,"can_vote":false,"vote_count":0,"user_voted":false,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id":null,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url":"https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/","details":{"can_edit":false,"notification_level":1,"participants":[{"id":1279198,"username":"Rich_Woodfin","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/b487fb/{size}.png","post_count":3,"primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":1},{"id":1441786,"username":"MMP58","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/mmp58/{size}/335691_2.png","post_count":2,"primary_group_name":"shopifystaff","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":1},{"id":1421958,"username":"DaisyVo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/daisyvo/{size}/109567_2.png